# Generated from the committed `web/openapi.json` by `npm run gen:types`, which the
# `build` script runs first. Deliberately not committed: the schema is the contract, and
# a checked-in copy of its output is one more thing that can silently disagree with it.
web/src/lib/types.gen.ts

# Bake-off outputs (scripts/model_bakeoff.py). The script is the reproducible artifact;
# its results are a dated experiment whose rating sheets go to the research group, not
# into the repo. Re-run it rather than reading a stale copy.
bakeoff-output/
